{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MolecularConstruction.EmbeddableKnotOperator","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MolecularConstruction.EmbeddableKnotOperator","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.multipleBond_binding_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.multipleBond_binding_one","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/embeddable-knot-operator.lean#L37-L40","doc":"A first-order bond (`k = 1`, a single axial channel) has binding `E₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.multipleBond_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.multipleBond_binding","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/embeddable-knot-operator.lean#L32-L35","doc":"Order-`k` bond binding: one axial channel (`w = 1`) plus `k-1` transverse\nchannels of weight `w⊥`, i.e. `E₀·(1 + (k-1)·w⊥)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.embeddableBinding_axial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.embeddableBinding_axial","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/embeddable-knot-operator.lean#L27-L30","doc":"An axial (`σ`-type) channel has overlap weight `1`, so its binding is the\nfull un-embedded channel binding. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.embeddableBinding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.embeddableBinding","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/embeddable-knot-operator.lean#L23-L25","doc":"Binding contribution of an embeddable knot operator: un-embedded channel\nbinding `E₀` scaled by the geometric overlap weight `w`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:embeddable-knot-operator","label":"def:embeddable-knot-operator","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/embeddable-knot-operator.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}